      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything feels so quiet now. like the person i was just... vanished. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the body looking back. it feels like a cage for someone who isn't there anymore. i used to be so precise, so controlled, and now i'm just this broken thing that can't even do the simplest things without pain. it's like the soul of me died with my career.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
